SPELLS - Your learned spells

Syntax: spells
        spell

Lists the spells your character currently knows, alphabetically, one per line.
Also shows your current and maximum mana. Spell is the short form of spells.

Use cast <spell> [target] to cast and help <spell-name> for a spell's rules.
Learning and casting retain the original class, level, mana and condition
requirements. A learned spell is not necessarily ready to cast right now.
If you know no spells, use help study to learn about studying scrolls.

This command only reads your character. It does not cast, spend mana, teach
spells, change cooldowns or save anything. Help spell shows this page;
help spells retains the original catalog of all spells in the game.
